//   Unconstrained preamble: each iteration increments steps by 1 and appends at
//   most 1 token, so |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps.
//   OpenConstrainedSpan: steps += 1, generated grows by 1 ("<<" delimiter).
//   Constrained loop: each iteration increments steps by 1, appends at most 1
